.nh
.TH podman-untag 1
.SH "نام (NAME)"
podman-untag \- Remove one or more names from a locally-stored image

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBpodman untag\fP \fIimage\fP [\fIname\fP[:\fItag\fP]...]

.PP
\fBpodman image untag\fP \fIimage\fP [\fIname\fP[:\fItag\fP]...]

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Remove one or more names from an image in the local storage.  The image can be referred to by ID or reference.  If no name is specified, all names are removed from the image.  If a specified name is a short name and does not include a registry, \fBlocalhost/\fR is prefixed (e.g., \fBfedora\fR -> \fBlocalhost/fedora\fR). If a specified name does not include a tag, \fB:latest\fR is appended (e.g., \fBlocalhost/fedora\fR -> \fBlocalhost/fedora:latest\fR).

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS \fB--help\fP, \fB-h\fP
Print usage statement

.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
Remove all tags from the specified image.

.EX
$ podman untag 0e3bbc2
.EE

.PP
Remove tag from specified image.

.EX
$ podman untag imageName:latest otherImageName:latest
.EE

.PP
Remove multiple tags from the specified image.

.EX
$ podman untag httpd myhttpd myregistryhost:5000/fedora/httpd:v2
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBpodman(1)\fP

